  "For the EP News Who Benefits From the Chaos? investigation, the measurable questions are whether Chinese-backed projects obtain financing, whether processing facilities begin operating, how many tonnes of minerals move under new contracts, how much value is retained in Gabon, and whether security cooperation produces documented capabilities or access. Diplomatic ceremony is evidence of activity, not a numerical influence score.",
  "The larger question is whether China can convert agreements into lasting economic and security leverage while Gabon secures the investment and domestic development it seeks. The agreements are real. Their net benefits, costs and strategic effects remain to be measured."
